    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Papa, the lackeys told me to tell you all the preparations are complete."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Hm? Papa, you don't seem very happy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Mhm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "How come? I thought you've been waiting for this day for a long time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Candela's a lot more difficult to deal with than you imagine. We mustn't let our guard down until the very last moment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Rafaela."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "If things look like they are about to take a turn for the worse, you make sure to get out of here with Ernesto."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Eh? I want to stay with you, Papa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Be a good girl and do as I say. You should never have been part of this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "If Old Pugh found out he entrusted his daughter to me only for me to make her go through all this, he'd probably dig his way out of his grave and kill me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "As for that brat Ernesto... Hmph..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "What about him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "He thinks I can't tell how he feels, but of course I can."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "He's not trying to betray us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "I know, and we won't see this through without him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "But he doesn't actually want to do this himself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Why is that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Who doesn't want to just eat well, sleep well, and worry about nothing else?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pancho reaches his hand to his adopted daughter's head and gives her a pet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Okay, be a good girl and bring me my pipe. I need some time alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_192_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela",
        "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
